However, the three, which might be any three, are
any three *of the specific bunch defined by {le
ro cribe}.*  So call it semispecific: it is more
restricted than {suoci lo ro cribe} but not as
much as {le ro cribe}.  I am not sure I get the
point here, but the in-mind restriction cpmes in
at the proper level -- the {le}, not the {su'oci}.


